{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"28":"Foods (Kitab Al-At'imah)"},"section_detail":{"28":{"hadithnumber_first":3736,"hadithnumber_last":3854,"arabicnumber_first":3736,"arabicnumber_last":3854,"name_native":"كتاب الأطعمة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3833,"arabicnumber":3833,"text":"حدثنا محمد بن كثير، اخبرنا همام، عن اسحاق بن عبد الله بن ابي طلحة، ان النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم كان يوتى بالتمر فيه دود فذكر معناه","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":28,"hadith":98}}]}